            plots, heatmaps, geographic maps, Sankey diagrams, and chord
            diagrams. A background manager handles the looping video layers
            behind them. The engine runs as plain ES modules and loads D3,
            d3-sankey and TopoJSON from CDNs. This lets a finished presentation
            run on a static host.
